同推动项目的实施和达成目标。\n7、具备良好的英语听说读写能力，能够流利地进行商务谈判和撰写相关文件。","ClassificationOne":"营销类","ClassificationTwo":"集团公司","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-03-05T09:22:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d7a742c9-62ef-48c6-b987-570075d174d5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230789449,"PostDateInt":1741137714000,"PostDate":"2025-03-05T09:21:54","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外解决方案工程师（匈牙利）(J21983)","OrgId":84327,"Org":"海外营销中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["匈牙利"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责项目需求调研，充分与国家销售人员、客户沟通交流，对需求进行挖掘和引导，输出解决方案；\n2. 负责行业标准化解决方案的制作，并对资料的应用情况进行持续跟踪和改进；\n3. 对代表处销售技术人员、以及客户进行产品解决方案培训；\n4. 负责行业研究，包括竞争对手方案优缺点研究，地区行业政策研究，行业未来趋势研究；\n5. 反馈和搜集项目售前问题，负责撰写客户交流后的需求分析书，依据客户需求提供合理的解决方案。\n6. 负责区域相关推广活动的进展管理和支持。","Require":"1. 5